Package: dev.filesdualpane.nativeprobe
Name: Files Native Probe
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Final restricted new native Split browser experiment for Files 16.6 (20G75). Independent dismissible container, isolated opening delegate and in-memory lifecycle export. Not a file-write sandbox.
